{"_id":"wmMark0000000001","name":"Tempered Construction — Blacksmithing — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-universal-tempered-construction"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000001","name":"Tempered Construction","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Tempered Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Universal</p><p>+10% item HP and +1 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000002","name":"Perfect Balance — Blacksmithing — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-universal-perfect-balance"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000002","name":"Perfect Balance","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Balance</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Universal</p><p>Reduce Bulk by 1 where sensible; weapon gains +1 Artisan bonus to one chosen Athletics manoeuvre made with it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000003","name":"Reinforced Edge — Blacksmithing — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-universal-reinforced-edge"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000003","name":"Reinforced Edge","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Edge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Universal</p><p>+1 damage per weapon damage die against objects/Hardness; +2 per die at T5+.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000004","name":"Fortified Frame — Blacksmithing — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-universal-fortified-frame"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000004","name":"Fortified Frame","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Fortified Frame</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Universal</p><p>Armour or shield gains +2 Hardness and +20% item HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, shield</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000005","name":"Master Reforge — Blacksmithing — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-universal-master-reforge"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000005","name":"Master Reforge","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Master Reforge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Universal</p><p>Recover 75% of ordinary/resource components when rebuilding and preserve compatible Wrathmaker work where physically possible.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000006","name":"Ember Temper — Blacksmithing — Hellforging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-1-ember-temper"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000006","name":"Ember Temper","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Ember Temper</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Hellforging</p><p>Weapon sheds controllable light; on a critical hit deal extra fire damage equal to Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000007","name":"Blood Temper — Blacksmithing — Hellforging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-1-blood-temper"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000007","name":"Blood Temper","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Blood Temper</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Hellforging</p><p>While at or below half HP, deal +2 damage; +4 at Core T5+.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000008","name":"Hellfire Channel — Blacksmithing — Hellforging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-1-hellfire-channel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000008","name":"Hellfire Channel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hellfire Channel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Hellforging</p><p>Once per encounter for 1 minute, weapon deals +1d6 fire at T2–3, +2d6 at T4–5, +3d6 at T6; half ignores fire resistance.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000009","name":"Tormentor's Edge — Blacksmithing — Hellforging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-1-tormentors-edge"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000009","name":"Tormentor's Edge","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Tormentor&#39;s Edge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Hellforging</p><p>Critical hits force a Will save vs wielder DC; failure frightened 1, critical failure frightened 2.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000010","name":"Perfected Killing Edge — Blacksmithing — Hellforging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-1-perfected-killing-edge"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000010","name":"Perfected Killing Edge","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfected Killing Edge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Hellforging</p><p>Weapon gains +1 attack beyond Core Material progression. Does not stack with another Over-Potency effect.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000011","name":"Soul-Burned Steel — Blacksmithing — Hellforging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-1-soul-burned-steel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000011","name":"Soul-Burned Steel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Soul-Burned Steel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Hellforging</p><p>Once/day when wielder would reach 0 HP, remain at 1 HP and immediately Step then Strike; afterwards become drained 1 until daily preparations.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000012","name":"Consecrated Finish — Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-2-consecrated-finish"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000012","name":"Consecrated Finish","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Consecrated Finish</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging</p><p>Item counts as sanctified for campaign interactions and grants +1 Artisan bonus to identify undead/fiends while worn or wielded.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000013","name":"Dawnbound — Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-2-dawnbound"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000013","name":"Dawnbound","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Dawnbound</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging</p><p>Weapon deals +1 spirit damage per weapon damage die to undead and fiends.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000014","name":"Guardian's Radiance — Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-2-guardians-radiance"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000014","name":"Guardian's Radiance","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Guardian&#39;s Radiance</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging</p><p>Once per round when an adjacent ally takes damage, reduce it by 2 + Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000015","name":"Aegis of Dawn — Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-2-aegis-of-dawn"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000015","name":"Aegis of Dawn","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Aegis of Dawn</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging</p><p>Wearer gains permanent Max HP equal to 4 × Core Tier and +1 resistance to spirit/void damage per Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000016","name":"Martyr's Forge — Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-2-martyrs-forge"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000016","name":"Martyr's Forge","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Martyr&#39;s Forge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging</p><p>Reaction once/encounter: take damage equal to twice your level to reduce damage to an ally within 15 ft by four times your level.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000017","name":"Solar Ascension — Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-2-solar-ascension"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000017","name":"Solar Ascension","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Solar Ascension</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Radiant Forging</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute, 20-ft aura: allies gain +1 Artisan bonus to AC and saves; undead/fiends take spirit damage equal to twice Core Tier at start of their turns.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000018","name":"Diagnostic Matrix — Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-3-diagnostic-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000018","name":"Diagnostic Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Diagnostic Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice</p><p>Item reports its condition; +2 Artisan bonus to Repair and Identify checks involving it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000019","name":"Integrated Conduit — Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-3-integrated-conduit"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000019","name":"Integrated Conduit","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Integrated Conduit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice</p><p>Item can house one Mana or Aetherglass component without increasing ordinary component Bulk/space.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000020","name":"Adaptive Configuration — Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-3-adaptive-configuration"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000020","name":"Adaptive Configuration","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Adaptive Configuration</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice</p><p>Choose two approved configurations at creation; one Interact action switches between them, such as damage type, weapon mode or tool function.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000021","name":"Arcane Mechanism — Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-3-arcane-mechanism"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000021","name":"Arcane Mechanism","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Arcane Mechanism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice</p><p>Add one once-per-encounter activated ability roughly appropriate to the item&#39;s tier/level and theme.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000022","name":"Phase Mechanism — Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-3-phase-mechanism"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000022","name":"Phase Mechanism","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Phase Mechanism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice</p><p>Once/encounter, wielder Steps or Strides up to half Speed through creatures and non-magical obstacles as if incorporeal; must end in open space.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000023","name":"Reality Engine — Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"blacksmithing-specialty-3-reality-engine"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000023","name":"Reality Engine","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reality Engine</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Blacksmithing — Azlanti Artifice</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute, item can maintain two mutually exclusive configurations simultaneously or ignore one normal activation prerequisite approved at creation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, mechanism, fittings, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): metal</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000024","name":"Stable Formula — Alchemy — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-universal-stable-formula"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000024","name":"Stable Formula","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Stable Formula</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Universal</p><p>Consumable remains potent twice as long and ignores the first normal environmental spoilage event.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000025","name":"Efficient Batch — Alchemy — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-universal-efficient-batch"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000025","name":"Efficient Batch","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Efficient Batch</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Universal</p><p>Produce +10% doses, rounded down; minimum +1 when crafting 4+ items.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000026","name":"Refined Reagent — Alchemy — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-universal-refined-reagent"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000026","name":"Refined Reagent","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Refined Reagent</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Universal</p><p>Increase one non-attack numerical consumable effect by 10%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000027","name":"Quick Preparation — Alchemy — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-universal-quick-preparation"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000027","name":"Quick Preparation","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Quick Preparation</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Universal</p><p>Reduce batch downtime by 20%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000028","name":"Catalyst Reserve — Alchemy — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-universal-catalyst-reserve"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000028","name":"Catalyst Reserve","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Catalyst Reserve</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Universal</p><p>When used as a component in another project, reduce one secondary resource requirement by 10%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000029","name":"Measured Dose — Alchemy — Grand Apothecary","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-1-measured-dose"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000029","name":"Measured Dose","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Measured Dose</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Grand Apothecary</p><p>Remove one minor drawback or reduce a fixed consumable drawback by 25%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000030","name":"Concentrated — Alchemy — Grand Apothecary","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-1-concentrated"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000030","name":"Concentrated","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Concentrated</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Grand Apothecary</p><p>Increase healing or temporary HP from the consumable by 25%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000031","name":"Extended Formula — Alchemy — Grand Apothecary","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-1-extended-formula"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000031","name":"Extended Formula","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Extended Formula</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Grand Apothecary</p><p>Double a duration of 1 minute or longer, maximum 24 hours unless the GM approves more.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000032","name":"Rapid Infusion — Alchemy — Grand Apothecary","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-1-rapid-infusion"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000032","name":"Rapid Infusion","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Rapid Infusion</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Grand Apothecary</p><p>Draw and drink/administer this consumable as a single action.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000033","name":"Restorative Panacea — Alchemy — Grand Apothecary","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-1-restorative-panacea"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000033","name":"Restorative Panacea","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Restorative Panacea</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Grand Apothecary</p><p>In addition to normal effect, reduce two of clumsy, enfeebled, frightened, sickened or stupefied by 1 and attempt one counteract check vs poison/disease/curse.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000034","name":"Phoenix Draught — Alchemy — Grand Apothecary","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-1-phoenix-draught"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000034","name":"Phoenix Draught","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Phoenix Draught</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Grand Apothecary</p><p>Once/day per creature, if consumed while above 0 HP it remains active for 1 hour; first time the creature would fall to 0 HP, it instead remains at 1 HP and gains temp HP equal to 3 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000035","name":"Masked Toxin — Alchemy — Venomcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-2-masked-toxin"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000035","name":"Masked Toxin","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Masked Toxin</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Venomcraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to the poison&#39;s DC against attempts to detect it before exposure.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000036","name":"Adhesive Poison — Alchemy — Venomcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-2-adhesive-poison"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000036","name":"Adhesive Poison","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Adhesive Poison</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Venomcraft</p><p>A failed Strike does not consume an applied injury poison; it remains until a successful Strike or the encounter ends.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000037","name":"Swift Venom — Alchemy — Venomcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-2-swift-venom"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000037","name":"Swift Venom","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Swift Venom</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Venomcraft</p><p>Reduce onset by one step; if no onset, failed initial save immediately applies Stage 1 before normal progression.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000038","name":"Predator Formula — Alchemy — Venomcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-2-predator-formula"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000038","name":"Predator Formula","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Predator Formula</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Venomcraft</p><p>Choose one creature family when crafted; poison DC gains +2 Artisan bonus against that family.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000039","name":"Mutagenic Venom — Alchemy — Venomcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-2-mutagenic-venom"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000039","name":"Mutagenic Venom","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mutagenic Venom</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Venomcraft</p><p>Add one approved Stage 3 rider such as slowed 1, stupefied 2 or enfeebled 2 for 1 round.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000040","name":"Perfect Killer — Alchemy — Venomcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-2-perfect-killer"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000040","name":"Perfect Killer","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Killer</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Venomcraft</p><p>Poison gains +1 DC beyond its normal item/tier DC and treats the first successful save against it as a failure once per target.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000041","name":"Purified Matrix — Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-3-purified-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000041","name":"Purified Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Purified Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy</p><p>Remove one undesirable mundane tag or impurity from a component.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000042","name":"Alchemical Alloy — Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-3-alchemical-alloy"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000042","name":"Alchemical Alloy","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Alchemical Alloy</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy</p><p>Component gains one approved material tag from a second same-tier material used in its creation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000043","name":"Composite Matrix — Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-3-composite-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000043","name":"Composite Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Composite Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy</p><p>Component can satisfy two compatible resource-family requirements while occupying one component position.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000044","name":"Refined Substance — Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-3-refined-substance"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000044","name":"Refined Substance","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Refined Substance</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy</p><p>For one named Artisan Mark, treat this component as 1 Tier higher, maximum effective T6; does not raise Core progression.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000045","name":"Philosopher's Matrix — Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-3-philosophers-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000045","name":"Philosopher's Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Philosopher&#39;s Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy</p><p>Once per project, substitute one missing non-unique resource family with equal quantity of another same-tier family.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000046","name":"Living Transmutation — Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"alchemy-specialty-3-living-transmutation"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000046","name":"Living Transmutation","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Transmutation</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Alchemy — Transmutative Alchemy</p><p>During daily preparations choose one of two pre-built material identities for the component; switch its native tags and compatible specialist hooks until next preparations.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, reagent, catalyst, lining</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000047","name":"Stable Matrix — Enchanting — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-universal-stable-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000047","name":"Stable Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Stable Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus when resisting suppression/counteraction of the item&#39;s custom magic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000048","name":"Attuned Craft — Enchanting — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-universal-attuned-craft"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000048","name":"Attuned Craft","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Attuned Craft</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Universal</p><p>Key custom activations to a wielder, tradition, deity, element or other approved identity.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000049","name":"Resonant Channel — Enchanting — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-universal-resonant-channel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000049","name":"Resonant Channel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resonant Channel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Universal</p><p>+1 charge to one custom daily charge pool, maximum +1 from this Mark.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000050","name":"Efficient Activation — Enchanting — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-universal-efficient-activation"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000050","name":"Efficient Activation","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Efficient Activation</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Universal</p><p>Once per encounter, reduce one approved 2-action custom item activation to 1 action.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000051","name":"Arcane Safeguard — Enchanting — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-universal-arcane-safeguard"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000051","name":"Arcane Safeguard","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Arcane Safeguard</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Universal</p><p>Reduce damage/penalties from a custom item overload or critical activation failure by 50%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000052","name":"Minor Empowerment — Enchanting — Aethercasting","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-1-minor-empowerment"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000052","name":"Minor Empowerment","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Minor Empowerment</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Aethercasting</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to one narrow skill use/subcategory agreed at creation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000053","name":"Focused Empowerment — Enchanting — Aethercasting","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-1-focused-empowerment"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000053","name":"Focused Empowerment","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Focused Empowerment</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Aethercasting</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to one selected secondary statistic such as initiative, a skill, or a specific save against one effect family.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000054","name":"Twin Empowerment — Enchanting — Aethercasting","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-1-twin-empowerment"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000054","name":"Twin Empowerment","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Twin Empowerment</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Aethercasting</p><p>Choose two different secondary statistics; each gains +1 Artisan bonus while attuned.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000055","name":"Overcharged Matrix — Enchanting — Aethercasting","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-1-overcharged-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000055","name":"Overcharged Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Overcharged Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Aethercasting</p><p>Once/encounter for 1 round, increase one existing Artisan numerical bonus on the item by +1.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000056","name":"Overlord Matrix — Enchanting — Aethercasting","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-1-overlord-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000056","name":"Overlord Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Overlord Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Aethercasting</p><p>Choose weapon attack or spell attack/DC when crafted; gain +1 beyond Core progression in that category. Does not stack with another Over-Potency effect.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000057","name":"Aetherheart Lattice — Enchanting — Aethercasting","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-1-aetherheart-lattice"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000057","name":"Aetherheart Lattice","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Aetherheart Lattice</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Aethercasting</p><p>Gain 2 charges/day; spend 1 to refresh one once-per-encounter Standard/Major activation on the item, or at start of turn gain temp HP equal to 2 × Core Tier if below half HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000058","name":"Minor Binding — Enchanting — Essencebinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-2-minor-binding"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000058","name":"Minor Binding","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Minor Binding</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Essencebinding</p><p>Add one non-combat descriptive/material trait or approved utility tag.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000059","name":"Bound Trait — Enchanting — Essencebinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-2-bound-trait"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000059","name":"Bound Trait","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Bound Trait</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Essencebinding</p><p>Add one approved item/weapon trait such as shove, trip, disarm, modular or versatile.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000060","name":"Elemental Essence — Enchanting — Essencebinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-2-elemental-essence"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000060","name":"Elemental Essence","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Elemental Essence</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Essencebinding</p><p>Weapon deals +1d6 acid/cold/electricity/fire at T2–3, +2d6 at T4–5, +3d6 at T6; defensive items instead grant resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000061","name":"Predatory Essence — Enchanting — Essencebinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-2-predatory-essence"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000061","name":"Predatory Essence","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Predatory Essence</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Essencebinding</p><p>Bind one source-derived sense or movement mode such as scent 30 ft, climb 15 ft, swim 20 ft or darkvision.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000062","name":"Greater Binding — Enchanting — Essencebinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-2-greater-binding"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000062","name":"Greater Binding","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Greater Binding</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Essencebinding</p><p>Add one strong source-derived property such as reach extension, a once-per-encounter special attack, or comparable extraordinary trait approved by GM.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000063","name":"Living Essence — Enchanting — Essencebinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-2-living-essence"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000063","name":"Living Essence","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Essence</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Essencebinding</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute the item awakens and manifests one high-tier transformation/ability based on the bound essence.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000064","name":"Runic Signature — Enchanting — Runecarving","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-3-runic-signature"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000064","name":"Runic Signature","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Runic Signature</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Runecarving</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to identify, repair or modify sigils made by this artisan.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000065","name":"Resonant Pair — Enchanting — Runecarving","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-3-resonant-pair"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000065","name":"Resonant Pair","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resonant Pair</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Runecarving</p><p>Link two crafted items; while within 30 ft each bearer gains +1 Artisan bonus to saves against effects created by the other&#39;s current target.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000066","name":"Layered Inscription — Enchanting — Runecarving","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-3-layered-inscription"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000066","name":"Layered Inscription","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Layered Inscription</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Runecarving</p><p>Choose one Standard Mark on the item; it can be toggled between two pre-defined modes during daily preparations.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000067","name":"Runic Feedback — Enchanting — Runecarving","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-3-runic-feedback"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000067","name":"Runic Feedback","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Runic Feedback</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Runecarving</p><p>Once/encounter when a linked weapon critically hits, paired item grants +2 Artisan bonus to its next attack, save or activation check before end of next turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000068","name":"Living Rune — Enchanting — Runecarving","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-3-living-rune"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000068","name":"Living Rune","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Rune</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Runecarving</p><p>One Major-or-lower custom effect on the item may switch between two equal-power versions with a single action once per encounter.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000069","name":"Grand Glyph — Enchanting — Runecarving","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"enchanting-specialty-3-grand-glyph"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000069","name":"Grand Glyph","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Grand Glyph</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Enchanting — Runecarving</p><p>Once/day place a 15-ft rune zone for 1 minute that reproduces one approved Standard/Major defensive or offensive item effect for allies/enemies in the area.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, lens, frame</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): mana-crystals, stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000070","name":"Flexible Construction — Leatherwork — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-universal-flexible-construction"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000070","name":"Flexible Construction","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Flexible Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Universal</p><p>Reduce one movement-related armour penalty by 1 where applicable.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000071","name":"Perfect Fit — Leatherwork — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-universal-perfect-fit"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000071","name":"Perfect Fit","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Fit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Universal</p><p>Reduce Bulk by 1 for worn leather/hide equipment and remove minor fitting penalties.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000072","name":"Reinforced Hide — Leatherwork — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-universal-reinforced-hide"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000072","name":"Reinforced Hide","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Hide</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Universal</p><p>+10% item HP and +1 Hardness; doubles at T5+.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000073","name":"Weather Seal — Leatherwork — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-universal-weather-seal"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000073","name":"Weather Seal","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Weather Seal</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Universal</p><p>Wearer gains +2 Artisan bonus to saves/checks against ordinary environmental exposure covered by the garment.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000074","name":"Adaptive Strapping — Leatherwork — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-universal-adaptive-strapping"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000074","name":"Adaptive Strapping","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Adaptive Strapping</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Universal</p><p>Once per round drawing/stowing one item secured to the gear is part of the same Interact action used to manipulate it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000075","name":"Wyrm Inscription — Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-1-wyrm-inscription"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000075","name":"Wyrm Inscription","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Wyrm Inscription</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft</p><p>Item visibly records source dragon; +2 Artisan bonus to identify or track lore tied to that dragon type.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000076","name":"Draconic Resistance — Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-1-draconic-resistance"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000076","name":"Draconic Resistance","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Draconic Resistance</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft</p><p>Requires Dragon Scale Core or Reinforcement. Increase the item&#39;s active native resistance by Dragon Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000077","name":"Scale Dominion — Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-1-scale-dominion"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000077","name":"Scale Dominion","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Scale Dominion</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft</p><p>Armour/shield gains +2 Hardness and +15 HP per Dragon Tier; weapon instead ignores resistance equal to Dragon Tier against the associated damage type.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000078","name":"Draconic Constitution — Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-1-draconic-constitution"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000078","name":"Draconic Constitution","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Draconic Constitution</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft</p><p>While attuned to worn armour, gain Max HP equal to 4 × Dragon Tier and a +2 Artisan bonus to saves against effects that deal the associated damage type; Green applies to poison effects. This replaces the Mark&#39;s former extra resistance.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000079","name":"Wyrm's Fury — Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-1-wyrms-fury"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000079","name":"Wyrm's Fury","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Wyrm&#39;s Fury</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft</p><p>Weapon gains +1 additional base weapon damage die beyond Core progression. Must use Dragon Scale Core or Reinforcement; does not stack with other Over-Striking.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000080","name":"Dragonheart Awakening — Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-1-dragonheart-awakening"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000080","name":"Dragonheart Awakening","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Dragonheart Awakening</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Wyrmcraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute gain fly Speed equal to land Speed, increase the active native resistance by 2 × Dragon Tier, and gain one 30-ft cone breath weapon dealing 2d6 per Dragon Tier, basic Reflex save. This increase stacks with Draconic Resistance on the same item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000081","name":"Trophy Memory — Leatherwork — Beastbinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-2-trophy-memory"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000081","name":"Trophy Memory","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Trophy Memory</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Beastbinding</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Recall Knowledge about the source creature family while carrying/wearing the item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000082","name":"Predator's Sense — Leatherwork — Beastbinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-2-predators-sense"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000082","name":"Predator's Sense","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Predator&#39;s Sense</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Beastbinding</p><p>Gain one source-appropriate sense such as scent 15 ft, low-light vision, or +2 Artisan bonus to tracking that creature family.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000083","name":"Natural Movement — Leatherwork — Beastbinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-2-natural-movement"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000083","name":"Natural Movement","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Natural Movement</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Beastbinding</p><p>Gain one source-appropriate movement mode: climb 15 ft, swim 20 ft, or +10 ft Speed in a defined natural environment.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000084","name":"Apex Hide — Leatherwork — Beastbinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-2-apex-hide"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000084","name":"Apex Hide","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Apex Hide</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Beastbinding</p><p>At start of combat gain temp HP equal to 3 × Core Tier and +1 Artisan bonus to saves against one source-creature theme such as fear, cold, poison or grabs.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000085","name":"Apex Trait — Leatherwork — Beastbinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-2-apex-trait"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000085","name":"Apex Trait","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Apex Trait</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Beastbinding</p><p>Gain one extraordinary source-derived trait/ability such as powerful leap, amphibious movement, tremorsense 15 ft, or comparable effect approved by GM.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000086","name":"Chimera Binding — Leatherwork — Beastbinding","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-2-chimera-binding"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000086","name":"Chimera Binding","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Chimera Binding</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Beastbinding</p><p>Combine two compatible creature-source properties in one item; choose which is active as a free action once per round, or activate both for 1 minute once/day.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000087","name":"Trophy Finish — Leatherwork — Mantlecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-3-trophy-finish"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000087","name":"Trophy Finish","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Trophy Finish</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Mantlecraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to social checks where the displayed trophy/source is relevant to status or intimidation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000088","name":"Weather Mantle — Leatherwork — Mantlecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-3-weather-mantle"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000088","name":"Weather Mantle","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Weather Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Mantlecraft</p><p>Ignore ordinary extreme-weather penalties and gain +2 Artisan bonus to saves against severe environmental exposure.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000089","name":"Predator's Cloak — Leatherwork — Mantlecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-3-predators-cloak"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000089","name":"Predator's Cloak","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Predator&#39;s Cloak</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Mantlecraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Stealth and Survival in one source-appropriate terrain; once/encounter Step 5 ft after successfully Hiding.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000090","name":"Court Mantle — Leatherwork — Mantlecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-3-court-mantle"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000090","name":"Court Mantle","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Court Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Mantlecraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Diplomacy and Society in formal settings; adjacent allies gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves against fear while wearer is conscious.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000091","name":"Sovereign Pelt — Leatherwork — Mantlecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-3-sovereign-pelt"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000091","name":"Sovereign Pelt","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sovereign Pelt</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Mantlecraft</p><p>Gain Max HP equal to 6 × Core Tier and +2 Artisan bonus to Intimidation or Diplomacy chosen when crafted.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000092","name":"Legendary Pelt — Leatherwork — Mantlecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"leatherwork-specialty-3-legendary-pelt"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000092","name":"Legendary Pelt","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Legendary Pelt</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Leatherwork — Mantlecraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute manifest one major supernatural trait of the source creature, such as invisibility, huge leap, elemental aura or transformation approved by GM.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, grip, strap, straps, backing, lining, wrap, cover</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): leather, dragon-scale</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000093","name":"Seasoned Construction — Carpentry — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"carpentry-universal-seasoned-construction"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000093","name":"Seasoned Construction","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Seasoned Construction</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Carpentry — Universal</p><p>Wooden item ignores normal warping/weathering and gains +10% item HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, haft, stock, staff, frame, grip</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
