{"_id":"wmMark0000000129","name":"Sanctuary Ward — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-2-sanctuary-ward"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000129","name":"Sanctuary Ward","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sanctuary Ward</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Allies in a 20-ft zone gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves and temp HP equal to Core Tier when they first enter each encounter.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000130","name":"War Rune — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-2-war-rune"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000130","name":"War Rune","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>War Rune</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Defenders in a 20-ft zone gain +1 Artisan bonus to attack rolls and damage equal to Core Tier on first successful Strike each round.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000131","name":"Fortress Sigil — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-2-fortress-sigil"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000131","name":"Fortress Sigil","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Fortress Sigil</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Large warded area suppresses hostile teleportation/forced planar entry unless attacker succeeds at a counteract/check against the ward&#39;s DC.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000132","name":"Dominion Ward — Stonemasonry — Runemasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-2-dominion-ward"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000132","name":"Dominion Ward","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Dominion Ward</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Runemasonry</p><p>Choose one hostile creature family or supernatural theme; within the ward they take a -1 Artisan penalty to attacks/saves and cannot benefit from concealment against authorised defenders.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000133","name":"Titanic Fit — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-3-titanic-fit"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000133","name":"Titanic Fit","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Titanic Fit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Ignore 1 Bulk of a stone component for encumbrance while properly worn/wielded.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000134","name":"Anchored — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-3-anchored"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000134","name":"Anchored","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Anchored</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus against forced movement, Trip and Reposition while using the item; count as one size larger for those effects where allowed.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000135","name":"Earthshaker — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-3-earthshaker"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000135","name":"Earthshaker","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Earthshaker</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Once/round on a critical hit or successful Shield Block, adjacent enemy must save or become off-guard and knocked 5 ft; critical failure also prone.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>shield</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000136","name":"Mountain Plate — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-3-mountain-plate"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000136","name":"Mountain Plate","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mountain Plate</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Worn armour grants physical resistance equal to Core Tier and Max HP equal to 4 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000137","name":"Mountain-Blood Plate — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-3-mountain-blood-plate"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000137","name":"Mountain-Blood Plate","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mountain-Blood Plate</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Worn armour grants Max HP equal to 8 × Core Tier and physical resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier. Does not stack with another Max-HP Artisan Mark.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000138","name":"Living Colossus — Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"stonemason-specialty-3-living-colossus"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000138","name":"Living Colossus","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Colossus</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Stonemasonry — Titanmasonry</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute increase size by one category, gain +5 ft reach, +2 Artisan bonus to Athletics and physical resistance equal to Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, frame, fittings, lens</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000139","name":"Perfect Clarity — Glassmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-universal-perfect-clarity"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000139","name":"Perfect Clarity","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Clarity</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to visual Perception checks made through the crafted optic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000140","name":"Hardened Glass — Glassmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-universal-hardened-glass"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000140","name":"Hardened Glass","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hardened Glass</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>Glass component gains +2 Hardness and +20% HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000141","name":"Arcane Lens — Glassmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-universal-arcane-lens"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000141","name":"Arcane Lens","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Arcane Lens</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>Item gains `arcane`, `optic`, `conductor` tags for compatible specialist Marks.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000142","name":"Precision Focus — Glassmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-universal-precision-focus"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000142","name":"Precision Focus","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Precision Focus</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to one approved ranged measurement/surveying check using the item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000143","name":"Shatter Safe — Glassmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-universal-shatter-safe"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000143","name":"Shatter Safe","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shatter Safe</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Universal</p><p>First time per day the glass component would be destroyed, it instead remains at 1 HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000144","name":"Calibrated Lens — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-1-calibrated-lens"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000144","name":"Calibrated Lens","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Calibrated Lens</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to visual Perception and range-estimation checks made through the optic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000145","name":"Focusing Lens — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-1-focusing-lens"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000145","name":"Focusing Lens","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Focusing Lens</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Ranged weapon/focus increases first range increment by 25%; spell focus gains +10 ft to one approved non-area range category.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000146","name":"Spectrum Prism — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-1-spectrum-prism"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000146","name":"Spectrum Prism","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Spectrum Prism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Choose two energy types at creation; once per round when dealing one, convert up to half the bonus energy damage to the other.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000147","name":"Beam Splitter — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-1-beam-splitter"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000147","name":"Beam Splitter","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Beam Splitter</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Once/encounter after a ranged Strike or single-target item activation hits, repeat 50% of its bonus damage/effect against a second target within 15 ft of the first.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000148","name":"Trueglass Crown — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-1-trueglass-crown"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000148","name":"Trueglass Crown","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Trueglass Crown</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Wearer gains constant see-invisibility-style perception within 30 ft and +2 Artisan bonus to checks/saves against visual illusions and concealment.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000149","name":"Crown Prism — Glassmaking — Prismcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-1-crown-prism"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000149","name":"Crown Prism","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Crown Prism</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Prismcraft</p><p>Spellcasting focus gains +1 spell attack and spell DC beyond Core progression. Does not stack with another Over-Potency effect; requires T5+ optical core/component.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000150","name":"Perfect Reflection — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-2-perfect-reflection"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000150","name":"Perfect Reflection","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Reflection</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Mirror retains flawless clarity and grants +1 Artisan bonus to visual identification or disguise checks using it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000151","name":"Truth Mirror — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-2-truth-mirror"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000151","name":"Truth Mirror","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Truth Mirror</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to checks to detect visual disguises, glamours and shape-changing seen in the mirror.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000152","name":"Reflective Ward — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-2-reflective-ward"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000152","name":"Reflective Ward","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reflective Ward</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Reaction once/encounter when targeted by a spell attack: gain +2 Artisan bonus to AC against it; if the attack critically misses, redirect a reduced version at an eligible target within 30 ft.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000153","name":"Doppelglass — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-2-doppelglass"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000153","name":"Doppelglass","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Doppelglass</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Once/encounter create a reflected duplicate until start of next turn, granting concealed against the next attack that targets you.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000154","name":"Gate Mirror — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-2-gate-mirror"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000154","name":"Gate Mirror","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Gate Mirror</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Pair with another crafted Gate Mirror; once/day transport willing creatures through the linked mirrors subject to GM-set distance/Kingdom infrastructure limits.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000155","name":"Mirror Lord — Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-2-mirror-lord"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000155","name":"Mirror Lord","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mirror Lord</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Mirrorcraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute, first hostile spell or ranged magical effect each round targeting wearer can be contested with a counteract-style check; success negates, critical success reflects it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000156","name":"Stable Cell — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-3-stable-cell"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000156","name":"Stable Cell","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Stable Cell</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Stored magical charge does not decay under ordinary downtime/environmental conditions.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000157","name":"Mana Reservoir — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-3-mana-reservoir"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000157","name":"Mana Reservoir","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mana Reservoir</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Item gains 1 charge/day usable by one listed custom activation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000158","name":"Arcane Conductor — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-3-arcane-conductor"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000158","name":"Arcane Conductor","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Arcane Conductor</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Increase one magical damage/healing effect generated by the item by +1 die; if effect has no dice, increase fixed value by 25%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000159","name":"Overflow Channel — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-3-overflow-channel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000159","name":"Overflow Channel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Overflow Channel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Once/encounter overcharge one activation: +50% range or +1 damage/healing die, but item loses 1 additional charge if it has charges.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000160","name":"Crystal Matrix — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-3-crystal-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000160","name":"Crystal Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Crystal Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Reduce the Capacity cost of one compatible Enchanting or Azlanti Artifice Mark on the same item by 1, minimum 1; the item still cannot exceed the Capacity granted by its Core Tier unless another explicit effect raises that maximum.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000161","name":"Eternity Cell — Glassmaking — Aetherglass","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"glassmaking-specialty-3-eternity-cell"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000161","name":"Eternity Cell","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Eternity Cell</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Glassmaking — Aetherglass</p><p>Item gains 3 charges/day and recovers 1 expended charge the first time each encounter the wearer critically succeeds at a relevant attack/save/activation check.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lens, catalyst, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000162","name":"Hardened Ceramic — Pottery — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-universal-hardened-ceramic"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000162","name":"Hardened Ceramic","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hardened Ceramic</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>+1 Hardness and +10% item HP.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000163","name":"Thermal Craft — Pottery — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-universal-thermal-craft"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000163","name":"Thermal Craft","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Thermal Craft</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>Container/component safely handles extreme mundane heat/cold.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000164","name":"Sealed Vessel — Pottery — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-universal-sealed-vessel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000164","name":"Sealed Vessel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sealed Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>Contents do not leak, evaporate or contaminate through ordinary damage until the vessel is Broken.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000165","name":"Shock-Fired — Pottery — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-universal-shock-fired"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000165","name":"Shock-Fired","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shock-Fired</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus against effects that would shatter or rupture the ceramic item.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000166","name":"Nested Chamber — Pottery — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-universal-nested-chamber"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000166","name":"Nested Chamber","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Nested Chamber</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Universal</p><p>Creates one concealed internal compartment or secondary reagent chamber.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000167","name":"Fired Seal — Pottery — Ceramancy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-1-fired-seal"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000167","name":"Fired Seal","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Fired Seal</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to identify or repair the ceramic component and its maker&#39;s construction pattern.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000168","name":"Ceramic Plate — Pottery — Ceramancy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-1-ceramic-plate"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000168","name":"Ceramic Plate","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Ceramic Plate</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Armour component gains +2 Hardness and +15 HP per Core Tier without increasing Bulk.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000169","name":"Living Clay — Pottery — Ceramancy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-1-living-clay"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000169","name":"Living Clay","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Clay</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>At start of wearer&#39;s turn, repair the item itself for HP equal to Core Tier if it is not Destroyed.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000170","name":"Terracotta Guardian — Pottery — Ceramancy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-1-terracotta-guardian"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000170","name":"Terracotta Guardian","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Terracotta Guardian</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Once/day animate a small guardian/figurine for 10 minutes; use a GM-approved creature profile appropriate to item tier, primarily defensive/support focused.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000171","name":"Adaptive Ceramic — Pottery — Ceramancy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-1-adaptive-ceramic"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000171","name":"Adaptive Ceramic","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Adaptive Ceramic</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Once/round when struck by physical damage, choose bludgeoning/piercing/slashing; gain resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier against that type until start of next turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000172","name":"Living Ceramic Shell — Pottery — Ceramancy","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-1-living-ceramic-shell"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000172","name":"Living Ceramic Shell","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Living Ceramic Shell</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Ceramancy</p><p>Worn armour grants regenerating temp HP equal to 2 × Core Tier at start of each turn if wearer has none; also repairs itself for same amount.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000173","name":"Sanctified Vessel — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-2-sanctified-vessel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000173","name":"Sanctified Vessel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sanctified Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to checks to identify the contained essence and prevents ordinary spiritual leakage.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000174","name":"Essence Vessel — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-2-essence-vessel"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000174","name":"Essence Vessel","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Essence Vessel</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Safely stores one harvested supernatural essence for later crafting without degradation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000175","name":"Bound Spirit — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-2-bound-spirit"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000175","name":"Bound Spirit","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Bound Spirit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>House one willing/controlled spirit; item can grant one minor sense, Lore or once/day guidance effect tied to that spirit.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000176","name":"Sealed Curse — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-2-sealed-curse"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000176","name":"Sealed Curse","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sealed Curse</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Contain one curse/hazard effect; while sealed it cannot spread normally and grants +2 Artisan bonus to counteract/manage it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000177","name":"Release Matrix — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-2-release-matrix"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000177","name":"Release Matrix","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Release Matrix</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Once/day deliberately discharge stored essence as a powerful item activation appropriate to the source; vessel then requires recharging/refilling.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000178","name":"Grand Reliquary — Pottery — Reliquarycraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-2-grand-reliquary"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000178","name":"Grand Reliquary","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Grand Reliquary</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Reliquarycraft</p><p>Safely maintain up to three compatible essences and switch the active one during daily preparations; once/day combine two for one Synergy-style activation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000179","name":"Heatproof Glaze — Pottery — Pyroceramics","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-3-heatproof-glaze"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000179","name":"Heatproof Glaze","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Heatproof Glaze</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Container/component ignores ordinary heat damage and gains +2 Artisan bonus against thermal breakage.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000180","name":"Thermal Crucible — Pottery — Pyroceramics","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-3-thermal-crucible"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000180","name":"Thermal Crucible","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Thermal Crucible</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>When used by another artisan processing heat-sensitive material, reduce material loss by 10%.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
