{"_id":"wmMark0000000182","name":"Shaped Charge — Pottery — Pyroceramics","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"pottery-specialty-3-shaped-charge"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000182","name":"Shaped Charge","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shaped Charge</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Pottery — Pyroceramics</p><p>Explosive item can trade splash radius for force: against one target/object deal +1 damage die per two Core Tiers, rounded up.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, catalyst, reagent</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): stone, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
