{"_id":"wmMark0000000188","name":"Weatherproof Weave — Weaving — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"weaving-universal-weatherproof-weave"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000188","name":"Weatherproof Weave","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Weatherproof Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Weaving — Universal</p><p>Wearer ignores ordinary rain/wind exposure and gains +1 Artisan bonus against severe weather.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>string, lining, backing, wrap, strap, straps, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon, armor, shield, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
