{"_id":"wmMark0000000211","name":"Encoded Script — Bookmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-universal-encoded-script"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000211","name":"Encoded Script","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Encoded Script</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to conceal or protect the text from unauthorised reading.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000212","name":"Reference Tabs — Bookmaking — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-universal-reference-tabs"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000212","name":"Reference Tabs","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reference Tabs</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Universal</p><p>Once per 10 minutes, gain +1 Artisan bonus to one Recall Knowledge check using the work&#39;s documented subject.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000213","name":"Indexed Arcana — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-1-indexed-arcana"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000213","name":"Indexed Arcana","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Indexed Arcana</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Recall Knowledge about spells recorded in the grimoire and instantly locate any known entry.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000214","name":"Mnemonic Pages — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-1-mnemonic-pages"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000214","name":"Mnemonic Pages","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Mnemonic Pages</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/day during preparation, swap one prepared/recorded spell choice of an appropriate rank without needing another full preparation period.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000215","name":"Resonant Chapter — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-1-resonant-chapter"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000215","name":"Resonant Chapter","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resonant Chapter</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Choose one spell trait/theme; spells of that theme gain +1 Artisan bonus to damage/healing per spell rank or +1 to one associated counteract/check, chosen at creation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000216","name":"Spell Echo — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-1-spell-echo"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000216","name":"Spell Echo","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Spell Echo</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/encounter after casting a spell from/through the grimoire, repeat one non-damaging minor rider or 50% of bonus damage/healing against the same or a second valid target.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000217","name":"Archmage Codex — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-1-archmage-codex"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000217","name":"Archmage Codex","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Archmage Codex</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute choose one mode: +25% spell range, ignore resistance equal to Core Tier, or add +1 spell damage/healing die.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000218","name":"Endless Grimoire — Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-1-endless-grimoire"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000218","name":"Endless Grimoire","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Endless Grimoire</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grimoirecraft</p><p>Once/day recover one expended spell slot or equivalent spell resource of a rank no higher than half Core Tier rounded up, subject to GM conversion for non-slot casters.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000219","name":"Scholar's Index — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-2-scholars-index"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000219","name":"Scholar's Index","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Scholar&#39;s Index</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to research checks using the chronicle&#39;s documented subject.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000220","name":"Lore Codex — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-2-lore-codex"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000220","name":"Lore Codex","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Lore Codex</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>After 10 minutes study, gain trained-equivalent access to one narrow Lore for 8 hours, or +1 Artisan bonus if already trained.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000221","name":"Crafting Manual — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-2-crafting-manual"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000221","name":"Crafting Manual","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Crafting Manual</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>For one recipe/category, reduce crafting downtime by 20% and gain +2 Artisan bonus to the first project check each day.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000222","name":"Tactical Treatise — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-2-tactical-treatise"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000222","name":"Tactical Treatise","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Tactical Treatise</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>After study, once/encounter gain +2 Artisan bonus to one attack, save or Recall Knowledge check against the documented enemy/tactic.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000223","name":"Master's Testament — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-2-masters-testament"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000223","name":"Master's Testament","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Master&#39;s Testament</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>After daily study, gain temporary access to one approved feat/technique for which you meet level prerequisites until next preparations.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000224","name":"Legendary Chronicle — Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-2-legendary-chronicle"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000224","name":"Legendary Chronicle","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Legendary Chronicle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Chroniclecraft</p><p>During preparations choose one documented discipline; up to six readers gain +1 Artisan bonus to related skill checks and one once/day reroll in that discipline.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000225","name":"Surveyor's Mark — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-3-surveyors-mark"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000225","name":"Surveyor's Mark","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Surveyor&#39;s Mark</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to navigation and Reconnoiter-style checks in mapped territory.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000226","name":"Safe Passage — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-3-safe-passage"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000226","name":"Safe Passage","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Safe Passage</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Party reduces non-combat travel delay from known mundane hazards by 25% in mapped territory.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000227","name":"Resource Survey — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-3-resource-survey"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000227","name":"Resource Survey","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Resource Survey</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Map can reveal one hidden or underexploited resource site after successful survey; Kingdom extraction from it gains +1 project bonus.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000228","name":"Strategic Map — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-3-strategic-map"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000228","name":"Strategic Map","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Strategic Map</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Armies/parties using the map gain +1 Artisan bonus to initiative or strategic movement checks in the mapped region.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000229","name":"Hidden Paths — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-3-hidden-paths"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000229","name":"Hidden Paths","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hidden Paths</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Discover or establish a secret route that reduces travel time by 25% and grants +2 Artisan bonus to avoid detection while using it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000230","name":"World Atlas — Bookmaking — Grand Cartography","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"bookmaking-specialty-3-world-atlas"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000230","name":"World Atlas","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>World Atlas</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Bookmaking — Grand Cartography</p><p>Atlas magically updates known mapped holdings; once per Kingdom turn designate one mapped region to gain a strong temporary bonus to travel, resource extraction or settlement planning.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>core, cover, catalyst</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): wood, leather, herbs, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000231","name":"Perfect Fit — Tailoring — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-universal-perfect-fit"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000231","name":"Perfect Fit","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Perfect Fit</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>Reduce worn garment Bulk by 1 where sensible and remove minor fitting penalties.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000232","name":"Reinforced Seam — Tailoring — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-universal-reinforced-seam"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000232","name":"Reinforced Seam","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reinforced Seam</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>+10% garment HP and +1 Hardness.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000233","name":"Hidden Pocketing — Tailoring — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-universal-hidden-pocketing"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000233","name":"Hidden Pocketing","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Hidden Pocketing</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to conceal one appropriately sized carried object.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000234","name":"Quick-Access Cut — Tailoring — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-universal-quick-access-cut"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000234","name":"Quick-Access Cut","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Quick-Access Cut</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>Once per round, draw one stored light object as part of the action used to activate/use it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000235","name":"Layered Lining — Tailoring — Universal","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-universal-layered-lining"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000235","name":"Layered Lining","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Layered Lining</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Universal</p><p>Garment can accept one eligible secondary textile/leather component without increasing Bulk.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000236","name":"Combat Cut — Tailoring — Battlestitching","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-1-combat-cut"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000236","name":"Combat Cut","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Combat Cut</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Reduce one minor worn-equipment movement/fitting penalty and +1 Artisan bonus to Acrobatics checks involving the garment&#39;s mobility.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000237","name":"Quickdraw Harness — Tailoring — Battlestitching","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-1-quickdraw-harness"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000237","name":"Quickdraw Harness","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Quickdraw Harness</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Once per round, draw one secured light weapon/item as part of the action used to wield or activate it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000238","name":"Vital Reinforcement — Tailoring — Battlestitching","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-1-vital-reinforcement"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000238","name":"Vital Reinforcement","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Vital Reinforcement</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>While attuned to worn armour/garment, gain Max HP equal to 5 × Core Tier. Does not stack with another Max-HP Artisan Mark.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000239","name":"Reactive Weave — Tailoring — Battlestitching","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-1-reactive-weave"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000239","name":"Reactive Weave","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Reactive Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Reaction once/round when damaged: reduce damage by Core Tier + 2; if attack was a critical hit, reduce by twice that amount.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000240","name":"War-Skin — Tailoring — Battlestitching","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-1-war-skin"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000240","name":"War-Skin","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>War-Skin</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>Worn armour gains +1 AC beyond Core progression, +5 ft Speed and physical resistance equal to Core Tier. Does not stack with another AC-over-Core effect.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4; Core-tier Anchor required</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000241","name":"War-Skin Regeneration — Tailoring — Battlestitching","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-1-war-skin-regeneration"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000241","name":"War-Skin Regeneration","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>War-Skin Regeneration</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Battlestitching</p><p>At start of each turn gain temp HP equal to 2 × Core Tier if you have none; if you took no damage since your previous turn, gain 3 × Core Tier instead.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000242","name":"Silent Stitch — Tailoring — Veilcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-2-silent-stitch"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000242","name":"Silent Stitch","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Silent Stitch</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Stealth checks where clothing noise would matter.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000243","name":"Chameleon Cloth — Tailoring — Veilcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-2-chameleon-cloth"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000243","name":"Chameleon Cloth","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Chameleon Cloth</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Hide/Sneak while stationary or moving at half Speed in a chosen environment palette.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000244","name":"Many-Faced Weave — Tailoring — Veilcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-2-many-faced-weave"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000244","name":"Many-Faced Weave","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Many-Faced Weave</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>As a 1-minute adjustment, alter apparent clothing, silhouette and facial framing; gain +2 Artisan bonus to impersonation/disguise checks.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000245","name":"Shadow Mantle — Tailoring — Veilcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-2-shadow-mantle"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000245","name":"Shadow Mantle","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Shadow Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>Once/encounter for 1 minute gain concealment while in dim light or darkness; first successful Strike each round does not end it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>weapon</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000246","name":"Phase Veil — Tailoring — Veilcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-2-phase-veil"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000246","name":"Phase Veil","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Phase Veil</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>Once/encounter for 1 round become partially incorporeal: move through creatures, gain physical resistance equal to 2 × Core Tier and ignore difficult terrain.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000247","name":"Null Mantle — Tailoring — Veilcraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-2-null-mantle"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000247","name":"Null Mantle","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Null Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Veilcraft</p><p>Once/day for 1 minute become invisible to mundane sight and gain +2 Artisan bonus against magical detection/counteract attempts; attacking suppresses invisibility until start of next turn.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000248","name":"Court Finish — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-3-court-finish"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000248","name":"Court Finish","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Court Finish</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>+1 Artisan bonus to Society checks involving formal protocol, heraldry or court presentation.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>minor</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>Workshop consumables only</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Only one zero-Capacity Artisan Mark is allowed per new item.</p><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000249","name":"Envoy's Raiment — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-3-envoys-raiment"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000249","name":"Envoy's Raiment","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Envoy&#39;s Raiment</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Diplomacy when acting in an official recognised capacity.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>standard</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000250","name":"Commander's Mantle — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-3-commanders-mantle"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000250","name":"Commander's Mantle","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Commander&#39;s Mantle</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>Allies within 15 ft gain +1 Artisan bonus to Aid and saves against fear while wearer is conscious and visibly acting as leader.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000251","name":"Judicator's Robes — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-3-judicators-robes"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000251","name":"Judicator's Robes","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Judicator&#39;s Robes</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>+2 Artisan bonus to Sense Motive and checks to detect deliberate lies or enforce formal authority; once/encounter designate one creature as under judgement, granting +1 to allies&#39; first save against it.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>major</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>1 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000252","name":"Sovereign Presence — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-3-sovereign-presence"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000252","name":"Sovereign Presence","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Sovereign Presence</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>30-ft aura for 1 minute once/encounter: allies gain +1 Artisan bonus to saves and enemies take -1 Artisan penalty to fear/mental saves against the wearer.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
{"_id":"wmMark0000000253","name":"Coronation Regalia — Tailoring — Regaliacraft","ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"artisanMarkReference":"tailoring-specialty-3-coronation-regalia"}},"pages":[{"_id":"wmMark0000000253","name":"Coronation Regalia","type":"text","sort":100000,"title":{"show":true,"level":1},"text":{"format":1,"content":"<h2>Coronation Regalia</h2><p><strong>Source:</strong> Tailoring — Regaliacraft</p><p>While worn by the recognised office-holder, grant Max HP equal to 5 × Core Tier, +1 Artisan bonus to Diplomacy/Intimidation, and once/day give allies within 30 ft temp HP equal to 3 × Core Tier.</p><table><tbody><tr><th>Grade</th><td>superior</td></tr><tr><th>Capacity</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Core Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Minimum Anchor Tier</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Anchor types</th><td>lining, backing, wrap, cover, core</td></tr><tr><th>Item groups</th><td>armor, spellFocus</td></tr><tr><th>Specialist materials</th><td>2 unit(s): herbs, leather, mana-crystals</td></tr><tr><th>Synergy tags</th><td>None</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reference only. Use the Workbench or GM Item Creator to apply this Mark; those tools check the exact item and Anchor compatibility.</p>"}}]}
